=== PE 883: Remarkable Harmonic Triangles ===

The harmonic mean of two numbers a and c is H = 2ac/(a+c).
When b = H(a,c) and a,b,c form a triangle, it's a harmonic triangle.

=== Distribution of side ratios ===
Total: 277 triples with perimeter ≤ 500

=== Special cases ===
Equilateral: a=b=c, this satisfies 2/a = 1/a+1/a ✓

PE answer: 14854003484704
